### AUTH ENDPOINTS - no setup needed

### Health check (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/healthcheck

### Register with invalid data: bad email, short password, passwords don't match (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "x",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Person",
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "short",
  "passwordCheck": "different"
}

### Register a username that already exists (expect 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mohel",
  "firstName": "Morten",
  "lastName": "Helander",
  "email": "morten@example.com",
  "password": "Str0ng!Passw0rd",
  "passwordCheck": "Str0ng!Passw0rd"
}

### Log in with correct credentials (expect 200 with token and roles)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mohel",
  "password": "Str0ng!Passw0rd"
}

### Log in with wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mohel",
  "password": "WrongPassword1!"
}

### Log in without a password (expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mohel"
}
